    "created_at": "2026-03-02T08:53:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-02T08:53:47Z",
    "body": "For an integrated approach: [idle-less](https://github.com/tvup/idle-less) is a Docker reverse proxy with built-in WoL. Instead of a dashboard widget triggering WoL manually, the proxy itself sends the magic packet automatically when someone visits the domain and the backend is sleeping.\n\nComplements a dashboard like Homarr \u2014 point your dashboard links through idle-less, and sleeping servers wake on click.\n\nhttps://github.com/tvup/idle-less",
